[112.926629, "o", "## Anomalies (observed facts)\r\n\r\n| Channel | Kind | Count | Note |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| zs_resync | zs_resync | 119 | capture-side: daemon zs_msg stream resync at EMIO-mux switches during self-injection — NOT a bus error |\r\n| i2c_frame:4 | i2c_byte | 30 | I2C read terminated by the master NACK on the last byte (normal end-of-read); verify against decoder semantics |\r\n"]
